AiTask qa_w56_category_drop_alert {
  label: "QA W56 Category Revenue Drop Alert"
  description: "TEMP QA (nhi.ty, 2026-11-10): alert run test of write_ai_task_result. Safe to delete."
  brief: @md
    1. From @Dataset:ecommerce_official, get revenue by product category for last week (the last complete Monday–Sunday week) and the week before.
    2. Find every category whose revenue dropped 15% or more.
    3. Write a short alert listing those categories with their revenue and change.

    Delivery: If at least one category dropped 15% or more, post the alert to the Slack channel #nhity-test. Otherwise, send nothing.
  ;;
  acceptance_criteria: @md
    - Covers exactly the last complete Monday–Sunday week and the week before.
    - Lists every category that dropped 15% or more, and no others.
  ;;
}
